# Task definitions that intentionally have no LIVE task yet.
#
# export-tasks.ps1 -Prune removes any .xml with no matching live task, on the
# reasoning that it is a leftover from a task deleted out of the fleet. It
# cannot tell that apart from a definition STAGED AHEAD of its install, and on
# 2026-09-19 it deleted both of the lines below - one of which was not yet
# committed and had to be rebuilt. Names listed here are skipped by -Prune.
#
# Remove a line once its task is registered; the live export then owns it.
# (empty) - both tunnel definitions were registered on 2026-09-19 and the live
# export now owns them, so nothing is staged ahead of its install.
